    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 \u2014 What a workflow actually is\n\nFour boxes, left to right. Data enters at the trigger and comes out changed at the end.\n\n**Run it, then click each node.** The panel splits in two: what came IN on the left, what went OUT on the right.\n\nThat split is the whole mental model. Every node takes data in and hands data out.\n\n**Ask the room:** where would a designer put the thing you are looking at? n8n puts it in a side panel over the canvas. Is that right?",
